  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/05/IMG_7425.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Benitand&uacute;s, la pedan&iacute;a de Alcudia de Veo, tambi&eacute;n ha vivido hoy actos en honor a la Virgen de los Desamparados o Amparadora. Se ha celebrado una misa en la iglesia, que s&oacute;lo se abre esta vez al a&ntilde;o, y se ha sacado a la virgen en procesi&oacute;n por las dos calles de&nbsp;este peque&ntilde;o n&uacute;cleo urbano.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/benitandusamparadora/img_7382.jpg\" alt=\"img_7382\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/benitandusamparadora/img_7383.jpg\" alt=\"img_7383\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/benitandusamparadora/img_7384.jpg\" alt=\"img_7384\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/benitandusamparadora/img_7385.jpg\" alt=\"img_7385\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/benitandusamparadora/img_7387.jpg\" alt=\"img_7387\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/benitandusamparadora/img_7388.jpg\" alt=\"img_7388\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/benitandusamparadora/img_7389.jpg\" alt=\"img_7389\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/benitandusamparadora/img_7390.jpg\" alt=\"img_7390\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/benitandusamparadora/img_7391.jpg\" alt=\"img_7391\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:au